Package: firedog
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dognet Technologies <info@dognet.tech>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dognet.tech
Depends: python3-venv, build-essential, libpq-dev, postgresql, redis-server, nginx, openssl, arp-scan, sudo, curl, iproute2
Description: FireDog - Centralized Firewall Management
